cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tesla Intelligence Core in research, testing, writing, or a derived project, please cite this repository."
title: "Tesla Intelligence Core"
version: "0.8.27.6"
date-released: "2026-09-28"
url: "https://github.com/prokyle123/tesla-intelligence-core"
repository-code: "https://github.com/prokyle123/tesla-intelligence-core"
license: "MIT"
authors:
  - name: "prokyle123"
abstract: >-
  A local-first, self-hosted Tesla telemetry and predictive intelligence system
  for Raspberry Pi. It learns thermal behavior, charging behavior, recurring
  departure patterns and trip context, and uses classical machine learning and
  PyTorch GRU sequence models for multi-horizon vehicle forecasts, truth
  validation and winter readiness.
keywords:
  - Tesla
  - electric vehicle
  - Raspberry Pi
  - machine learning
  - PyTorch
  - battery thermal monitoring
  - Level 1 charging
  - winter driving
  - telemetry
  - time-series forecasting
